        "## Stage C — Bundle Component Integrity & Original Artifact Comparison\n",
        "\n",
        "This stage verifies the packaged bundle structure at `bundles/protocol_B_lr/`.\n",
        "It audits `bundle.json`, validates that each declared component exists on disk, computes independent byte counts and SHA-256 digests, compares them against the manifest, validates component paths against directory traversal / absolute paths, and directly compares original R2-M1 artifacts against their packaged counterparts.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Inspection & Comparison Criteria\n",
        "- `bundle.json` exists and parses cleanly.\n",
        "- Every component path is validated against traversal (`..`, `.`), backslashes (`\\`), absolute paths, and paths resolving outside the bundle directory.\n",
        "- Every component declared in `components` exists on disk.\n",
        "- Each component's byte count matches the recorded size.\n",
        "- Each component's SHA-256 digest matches the recorded hash.\n",
        "- Direct original-to-packaged comparison: Original R2-M1 `lr_model.json` and `weights.npz` must match their packaged counterparts in both SHA-256 hash AND byte count. Any mismatch must fail verification.\n",
        "- No undeclared files exist in `model/` or the bundle directory."
      ]
